# `+start 1` holding it a tick); then a walk. The pause's ticks count on the game's clock.
start axel
until state 1 ready
wait 30
+start 1
wait 20
+start 1
wait 31
+start 1
wait 21
+start 1
wait 2
right 30
wait 10
